*   **Island/Spirebluff Canal [Land]:** I can still play a land for the turn! I have an Island and a Spirebluff Canal in hand. I should definitely play one of those!\n\
*   **Winternight Stories {2}{U} [Cast]:** I have two of these in hand! For {2}{U}, I can cast an instant or sorcery from my hand without paying its mana cost, then put it on the bottom of my library. This could be HUGE!\n\
\n\
