      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Casting Burst Lightning for 2 damage to the opponent's face on turn 1 with no board pressure is a waste of a card. Burst Lightning is valuable removal that could deal with an early creature threat or be saved for a kicked 4-damage removal later. With a hand containing Sarkhan and Dragonhawk as the game plan, using burn as face damage this early accomplishes almost nothing — 2 damage to a 20-life opponent without any clock is negligible. This is effectively throwing away a card for minimal impact.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Burst Lightning targeting opponent's face for 2 damage on turn 1",
