      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing a basic Mountain when Maelstrom of the Spirit Dragon or Sunbillow Verge would have been more optimal. Maelstrom produces colorless (sufficient for Sarkhan's {1}{R} with existing Mountain) while also providing Dragon-colored mana for Dragonhawk later and preserving its tutor ability. Playing the basic Mountain is the least flexible choice since the other utility lands all enable the same turn-2 Sarkhan cast.",
      "action_taken": "Played basic Mountain as the turn 2 land drop",
      "better_line": "Play Maelstrom of the Spirit Dragon - it still enables turn 2 Sarkhan ({C} from Maelstrom + {R} from Mountain = {1}{R}), provides colored mana for Dragon spells like Dragonhawk later, and preserves its sacrifice-tutor ability. Alternatively, Sunbillow Verge also works while saving the basic Mountain for later flexibility.",
